00:05:09.676 --> 00:05:12.245 align:start size:81% position:19%
but pretty much
nobody mainstream,

00:05:12.245 --> 00:05:15.715
nobody on the left, but
this seems big to me.

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:16.983
