00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.918
I mean, Biden and Kerry
have to answer for this.

00:05:20.586 --> 00:05:24.057
First of all, if it's
true, he can't be--

00:05:24.057 --> 00:05:26.359 align:start size:97% position:3%
