00:05:39.405 --> 00:05:42.008 align:start size:84% position:16%
Obama and Kerry
never liked Israel.

00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:43.910 align:start size:84% position:16%
They basically stabbed
Israel in the back

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.678
