anything I can imagine.

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:06.399
But it's so typical of the
Obama 2.0, it's so typical.

00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:08.067
And I think it's dangerous.

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:09.435
And I don't trust Kerry,

00:06:09.435 --> 00:06:12.205
I don't trust him to
not have done this,

00:06:12.205 --> 00:06:14.907
I don't trust Biden to
make Kerry answer for it,

00:06:14.907 --> 00:06:16.676 align:start size:84% position:16%
and I think we still
have to be loud

00:06:16.676 --> 00:06:18.478
