this is not okay.

00:06:18.478 --> 00:06:20.747 align:start size:88% position:13%
- What do you make
generally of John Kerry

00:06:20.747 --> 00:06:23.249
because it seems like
he's gotten pretty much

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:24.984
