things that he has said

00:06:29.489 --> 00:06:32.358 align:start size:84% position:16%
that he has just
predicted to be wrong.

00:06:32.358 --> 00:06:34.127
- I mean, I just think
he was the one that said

00:06:34.127 --> 00:06:35.695 align:start size:84% position:16%
