nuclear warheads again.

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:55.948 align:start position:0%
And he said, well, yeah, we
just knew it was a stall tactic.

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:57.316
Well, stalling is not okay,

00:06:57.316 --> 00:06:58.785
fixing is the way to do it.

00:06:58.785 --> 00:07:02.388 align:start size:97% position:3%
And so even if it's Biden
getting on this electric bike,

00:07:02.388 --> 00:07:04.524
after he gets off
his private plane,

00:07:04.524 --> 00:07:06.225
it's just hypocritical at best.

00:07:06.225 --> 00:07:09.061
And that's why I don't
think we can trust him,

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:10.296
that's why I think anything

00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:12.799
that he gets involved
in he's an elitist.

00:07:12.799 --> 00:07:15.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's an elitist liberal
who thinks he knows better

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:17.737
than everybody else and
talks down everyone.

00:07:17.737 --> 00:07:18.971
- Well, there's that video

00:07:18.971 --> 00:07:21.307 align:start size:84% position:16%
of when he was getting
on his private jet,

00:07:21.307 --> 00:07:23.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
he said, well I have
important business to do.

00:07:23.376 --> 00:07:25.044
That's why I can be
on a private jet.

00:07:25.044 --> 00:07:27.647 align:start size:97% position:3%
Not you Peons, you guys
are all just doing nothing.

00:07:27.647 --> 00:07:30.216
- It's so hypocritical.

00:07:30.216 --> 00:07:32.218 align:start size:84% position:16%
The idea when we
all heard John Kerry

00:07:32.218 --> 00:07:34.120 align:start size:84% position:16%
was going to be
back in the cabinet,

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.321
in the National
Security Council,

00:07:35.321 --> 00:07:37.156 align:start size:81% position:19%
I think we all
took a breath back

00:07:37.156 --> 00:07:40.293
because we knew how much
he wanted that Iran deal.

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:43.963 align:start size:97% position:3%
And even though he's
supposedly the climate Envoy,

00:07:43.963 --> 00:07:47.133 align:start size:97% position:3%
he's gonna always be weighing
in on all issues of Iran.

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:48.835
That's why I think Biden
needs to answer for it.

00:07:48.835 --> 00:07:50.736 align:start size:81% position:19%
And this is really
serious stuff.

00:07:50.736 --> 00:07:53.206
- But do you think the
media will do anything?

00:07:53.206 --> 00:07:55.374
I mean, that partly
I talk on the show

00:07:55.374 --> 00:07:56.642
all the time now about that,

00:07:56.642 --> 00:07:58.177
we're basically just
in this reality war.

00:07:58.177 --> 00:08:00.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like half the people
will see that story

00:08:00.813 --> 00:08:02.715 align:start size:88% position:13%
and be like, oh,
there's something here.

00:08:02.715 --> 00:08:04.183 align:start size:88% position:13%
And then the other
half just won't see it.

00:08:04.183 --> 00:08:06.586 align:start size:97% position:3%
And then it's like, well
now we're just fighting over

00:08:06.586 --> 00:08:07.820
