00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.622 align:start size:88% position:13%
- It's the reason nobody
trusts media anymore.

00:08:09.622 --> 00:08:10.890
I mean, why should you?

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:11.991
You're getting one
side of the story.

00:08:11.991 --> 00:08:13.693
You go to any cable network

00:08:13.693 --> 00:08:18.464
