00:08:18.464 --> 00:08:21.067 align:start position:0%
What happened to the days where
you just gave us the facts

00:08:21.067 --> 00:08:23.102
and we decided what
we wanted to think?

00:08:23.102 --> 00:08:24.704
And I think the days
of those are gone.

00:08:24.704 --> 00:08:27.540 align:start position:0%
So you'll never see CNN
talking about Kerry doing this,

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.842 align:start size:84% position:16%
you'll never see MSNBC
talking about it.

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:32.111
And you know, I think we
still have to be loud.

00:08:32.111 --> 00:08:33.312
I think we have to push it.

00:08:33.312 --> 00:08:34.780 align:start size:84% position:16%
But it's the same
thing with the border

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.349
