We can talk about how many
days she hasn't been there.

00:08:39.051 --> 00:08:41.754 align:start size:97% position:3%
But you know, even though, you
know, they're uncomfortable

00:08:41.754 --> 00:08:43.756 align:start size:88% position:13%
with the situation,
they won't say anything.

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:45.725 align:start position:0%
- Well, when they cover it,
