00:08:45.725 --> 00:08:47.994
That's where they always
say, oh, Republicans pounce

00:08:47.994 --> 00:08:50.029 align:start size:97% position:3%
on the thing that we
shouldn't be talking about.

00:08:50.029 --> 00:08:51.030
All right.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.532
Let's shift away from that

00:08:52.532 --> 00:08:53.900
and it will come back to
