00:38:55.232 --> 00:38:57.134 align:start size:84% position:16%
much tougher than
the one Georgia did.

00:38:58.035 --> 00:38:59.704
And I said at the time,

00:38:59.704 --> 00:39:02.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you have to show
picture ID to buy Sudafed,

00:39:02.106 --> 00:39:03.841 align:start size:88% position:13%
you have to show picture
ID to get on a plane,

00:39:03.841 --> 00:39:05.376 align:start size:81% position:19%
you should have
to show picture ID

00:39:05.376 --> 00:39:08.379
to protect the election process.

00:39:08.379 --> 00:39:10.614
I was vilified at
the time they said

00:39:10.614 --> 00:39:13.250
that I was trying to
disenfranchise voters,

00:39:13.250 --> 00:39:15.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
that a lot of people
couldn't get picture IDs,

00:39:15.519 --> 00:39:17.088
and I said, okay, fine.

00:39:17.088 --> 00:39:20.124
If that's the case,
I will send someone,

00:39:20.124 --> 00:39:22.727
we will pick you up, we
will take you to the DMV,

00:39:22.727 --> 00:39:24.161
we will get you
a free picture ID

00:39:24.161 --> 00:39:25.396
and we will return you home.

00:39:25.396 --> 00:39:26.864
- I know the numbers So
I'm going to say yep.

00:39:26.864 --> 00:39:28.699
How many people went
in on that program?

00:39:28.699 --> 00:39:32.036 line:0%
- After 5 million people, 25.

00:39:32.036 --> 00:39:34.672 line:0%
25 people asked for a ride.

00:39:34.672 --> 00:39:36.240 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
The number of
people that now vote

00:39:36.240 --> 00:39:38.576 line:0%
in South Carolina is higher.

00:39:38.576 --> 00:39:40.778
The part that was so offensive,

00:39:40.778 --> 00:39:43.948
don't assume minorities
can't get a picture ID.

00:39:43.948 --> 00:39:46.751
Don't assume we can't
go get a picture ID,

00:39:46.751 --> 00:39:48.285 align:start size:84% position:16%
Don't assume we can't
pick the schools

00:39:48.285 --> 00:39:50.020
we want our kids to go to.

00:39:50.020 --> 00:39:52.189 align:start size:88% position:13%
It's actually Democrats
that are racist

00:39:52.189 --> 00:39:56.360 align:start size:88% position:13%
that treat us like we
are inferior, incapable,

00:39:56.360 --> 00:39:59.463
and it's offensive on so
many different levels.

00:39:59.463 --> 00:40:02.099 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Well, it's also specifically
racist to black people

00:40:02.099 --> 00:40:03.567
because even though
you're saying we,

00:40:03.567 --> 00:40:05.603
you know they don't
mean Indian people.

00:40:05.603 --> 00:40:09.340 align:start position:0%
Like that's part of the odd
position that Indians are now in

00:40:09.340 --> 00:40:12.443
that Indian-Americans are now
in as a successful minority.

00:40:12.443 --> 00:40:14.812 align:start position:0%
- Look at this, so they're
sitting there and they're going

00:40:14.812 --> 00:40:17.515
through all this stop
Asian hate all of this

00:40:17.515 --> 00:40:20.317 align:start size:97% position:3%
but why was it the Democrats
that shot down the part

00:40:20.317 --> 00:40:22.553 align:start size:97% position:3%
that said stop discrimination
of Asians in schools?

00:40:22.553 --> 00:40:24.655 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Just in the last
couple of days.

00:40:24.655 --> 00:40:27.191 align:start size:84% position:16%
- So it's just
hypocritical in terms

00:40:27.191 --> 00:40:30.594
of what they think is
racist and what's not.

00:40:30.594 --> 00:40:32.396
When you're Brown,
it's almost worse

00:40:32.396 --> 00:40:34.331 align:start size:88% position:13%
because they think
you're not black enough

00:40:34.331 --> 00:40:37.301
or you don't count or
