00:40:37.301 --> 00:40:39.970
against you in schools but
hey, don't mess with them

00:40:39.970 --> 00:40:41.272
when they're trying to vote.

00:40:41.272 --> 00:40:43.140
All of these things
but all of that does

00:40:43.140 --> 00:40:46.177 align:start size:84% position:16%
is it assumes
minorities are dumb

00:40:46.177 --> 00:40:48.746 align:start size:88% position:13%
and it assumes
minorities are less then

00:40:48.746 --> 00:40:51.081
