00:44:45.349 --> 00:44:48.252 align:start size:97% position:3%
The problem is we lost
women, we lost the suburbs,

00:44:48.252 --> 00:44:51.255
but more importantly, we
have to expand our tent.

00:44:51.255 --> 00:44:53.090
We've got to reach
out to Hispanics,

00:44:53.090 --> 00:44:54.958
we've got to reach out
to the Jewish community,

00:44:54.958 --> 00:44:57.027
we've got to reach out to Asians

00:44:57.027 --> 00:44:59.563
and make sure that we
have that conversation.

00:44:59.563 --> 00:45:01.899
African-Americans I did
it in South Carolina,

00:45:01.899 --> 00:45:04.468
it can be done, but
