00:45:08.572 --> 00:45:10.641
And when you have
that conversation,

00:45:10.641 --> 00:45:13.644
suddenly they realize you
care about the same things.

00:45:13.644 --> 00:45:15.479
And then you have
a conversation,

00:45:15.479 --> 00:45:17.781 align:start size:88% position:13%
I know if I went and
