it takes more time,

00:45:28.692 --> 00:45:30.260
it takes more effort,

00:45:30.260 --> 00:45:33.497 align:start size:88% position:13%
but if we do it, we
will be a better party.

00:45:33.497 --> 00:45:35.966 align:start size:97% position:3%
Do you know, we've lost
the last seven out of eight

00:45:35.966 --> 00:45:38.802
